{"id":"amenaza","lemma":"amenaza","pos":"noun","rank":1162,"glosses":["threat, menace, an indication of danger","threat, menace, an expression of intent"],"ipa":"/ameˈnaθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"amenazas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-amenaza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tú eres una amenaza.","en":"You're a menace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831423"},{"text":"No me asustan tus amenazas.","en":"Your threats don't frighten me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590019"},{"text":"Es usted una amenaza.","en":"You're a menace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831424"},{"text":"No te tomes en serio las amenazas de Tom.","en":"Don't take Tom's threats seriously."},{"text":"Tom no es una amenaza.","en":"Tom isn't a threat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800396"}]}